@startuml
title UC03 Request Appointment — black-box SSD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 350
hide footbox
actor "Authorised clinic staff\n(patient self-service uses own-patient scope)" as Actor
participant "Appointment Tracking System\n(black box)" as System

note over Actor, System
  UC03 steps 1–8. Session actor is implicit in every event.
  Only actor and system are lifelines; validation, reservation and audit are internal responsibilities.
end note

Actor -> System : searchPatient(criteria)
alt invalid criteria, denied scope or no permitted matches
  break Patient identification failed — no scheduling or booking may follow
    System --> Actor : safe failure / no matches; denial audited when applicable
  end
else permitted patient matches
  System --> Actor : minimal identity matches with patientIDs
end
note over Actor
  Verify one patient; refine ambiguous criteria
  by repeating searchPatient before continuing.
end note

Actor -> System : searchAvailability(serviceID, professionalID, locationID, dateRange)
alt invalid offering/range, denied search or no candidates
  break No eligible candidate — no appointment request in this attempt
    System --> Actor : safe failure / no available intervals; no hold
  end
else candidate intervals exist
  System --> Actor : candidate start times and duration; no reservation
end
note over Actor, System
  Availability cannot establish patient-specific eligibility (no patientID parameter).
  Actor chooses a time and any referralID. Required-referral checking applies
  even when referralID is absent. Selection does not reserve the slot.
end note

Actor -> System : requestAppointment(patientID,serviceID,professionalID,locationID,startTime,referralID?)
alt patient scope/authority no longer valid
  break Request denied
    System --> Actor : safe denial; audit metadata; no appointment or reservation
  end
else offering/schedule/full duration/overlap invalid, including slot taken since search
  break Scheduling failed
    System --> Actor : scheduling failure; no appointment or reservation
  end
else required referral absent OR supplied referral unusable/mismatched
  break Referral validation failed
    System --> Actor : safe referral failure; no appointment or reservation
  end
else all authorisation, scheduling and referral rules pass
  alt write and required audit evidence retained
    System --> Actor : appointmentID, requested, safe booking summary\n(slot reserved; arrival absent; confirmation is separate UC04)
  else write or required audit retention fails
    break No success may be reported
      System --> Actor : request failed; no appointment or reservation committed
    end
  end
end

note over Actor, System
  Success: exactly one requested appointment reserves the full interval.
  No implicit confirmation, arrival or consultation. Sensitive reads, successful
  writes and denied actions are audited without clinical content or raw criteria.
  UC03 extensions 1a/2a, 3a/4a, 6a–6c and 7a; rules BR01–BR06, BR09, BR13.
end note
@enduml
